# Docker
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Local dev override -- must never land on a server checkout (Compose auto-loads
# this exact filename on any bare `docker compose up`, which is how PostgreSQL's
# port ended up published to the internet on production, 2026-08-08). Copy
# docker-compose.override.yml.dist to get started locally; see docs/SETUP.md.
docker-compose.override.yml

